{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id38197048"}, "name":{"label":"Oneideatoday"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-07-20T09:37:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1230386714"}, "title":{"label":"Great App but..."}, "content":{"label":"I love the layout, suggestions and ease of use of this app....But and its not a big one , how about the ability to add more than six goals. The goals I have set have been helped greatly by this app however I have to revert to other apps to set more goals.6 goals is very limited especially when you when some goals you only want to do once a month etc. I hope this will be sorted in future updates as I want this to be my app of choice rather than part of the answer to achieving my goals. Remove the limit and it gets 5 stars instead of 4", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
