{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id190575916"}, "name":{"label":"bills6693"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-07-15T14:51:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1227831917"}, "title":{"label":"It works!"}, "content":{"label":"It's a really handy app that actually works well to train and solidify mundane things I want to make habits. It holds me accountable to myself if I don't do it and makes it a fun little reward for having done it. Great!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id174588686"}, "name":{"label":"DragonPandax"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-07-15T13:03:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1227799601"}, "title":{"label":"Nice app!"}, "content":{"label":"It's a nice app! There are, however, a few things that could be improved. \n\nI'd like to see a bit more colour in the app, like perhaps the option to change the colour of the icons instead of having just one solid colour for the background. Would make the app more fun to use overall!\n\nAlso, it would be nice to have the option to have a counter for different habits. For example, one of my habits is to write 1000 words a day - so it would be nice to have the option to split my habit up throughout the day. \n\nAnother thing that would be great, is if I could add a weekly habit (read x books a week).\n\nIt's a great start!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id371616415"}, "name":{"label":"Jazz's reviews!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-07-14T12:50:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1227293176"}, "title":{"label":"WOW - what can I say?!?!"}, "content":{"label":"This app is sooooo amazing! Really easy to use - once I started adding tasks the app would link the task to an icon that matched... And honestly I had some pretty weird ones but they had all the icons (they have looaaadds) and you can change the colour of the screen when you come into the app. Just the little things like that make this app so much better! The tasks are easy to do, the app is lovely and easy to use - probably one of my favourite apps out there and if you're wondering weather to spend the money, spend it. It's worth every penny I paid for!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id283695129"}, "name":{"label":"Daniel17452"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2015-07-10T16:47:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1225268186"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant for tracking long term life goals"}, "content":{"label":"I've always wanted something which shows when I screw up going to the gym (or when I'm brilliant), tracking How well I take my medication or how often I eat 5 fruits and vegetables. With this app I can see my good weeks bad weeks and rate my overall day from an objective perspective opposed to being overly pessimistic. I think it's a great app for anyone trying to achieve something over an extended period, such as going smoke free.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
